<title>BELGIUM: Belgian beet plantings advance in latest week.</title>
<headline>Belgian beet plantings advance in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian beet plantings to March 26 were as follows, the sugarbeet association said on Thursday -</p>
<p> Sown so far:   1,565 ha or 1.53 pct of total</p>
<p>planned total area:  102,586 ha</p>
<p>1996 total area:  103,849 ha</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
